        "html": "Effective depth: D/2 + half-ring centroid 2r/π, weighted by bar area",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7c",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 11169,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "d\\coloneq\\frac{D}{2}+\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{n_{l1}A_{b1}r_{1}+\\delta_{2}n_{l2}A_{b2}r_{2}}{n_{l1}A_{b1}+\\delta_{2}n_{l2}A_{b2}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11236,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Lever arm",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7e",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 11229,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "z\\coloneq0.9d",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11276,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Web width",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7g",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 11269,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "b_{w}\\coloneq D",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11319,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "7.2 Strut angle",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11349,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Spirals carry VEd through a truss: concrete struts at angle θ, spirals as ties (EC2 6.2.3).",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11379,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Compression: a flatter strut (larger cotθ) needs fewer spirals, but the strut crushes",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11409,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "when VEd &gt; VRd,max = bw·z·ν1·fcd / (cotθ + tanθ). So cotθ is the largest value with",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11439,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "cotθ + tanθ ≤ a = bw·z·ν1·fcd / VEd, capped at 2.5 (a ≥ 2.9 gives 2.5; a &lt; 2 fails).",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11489,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strut ratio a: limit of cotθ + tanθ for this VEd",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7n",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 11489,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "a\\coloneq\\frac{b_{w}z\\nu_{1}f_{cd.v}}{V_{Ed}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11797,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "The strut can carry VEd at θ = 45°",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7p",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 11790,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "a\\ge2",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11834,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Largest cotθ: larger root of cotθ + 1/cotθ = a (≤ 2.5)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7r",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 11870,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\mathrm{cot}_{\\theta.opt}\\coloneq\\min\\left(2.5,0.5\\left(a+\\sqrt{\\max\\left(a^2-4,0\\right)}\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 2,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11920,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Tension (NEd &lt; 0): θ from CSA A23.3, θ = 29° + 7000·εx, εx = strain at mid-depth from",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11950,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "the tension chord force; cotθ is kept between 1 and cotθ,opt. Compression uses cotθ,opt.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12007,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Bars in the flexural tension half (CSA)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7v",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 12000,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "A_{s.t}\\coloneq0.5A_{st}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm^2",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12047,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Effective shear depth (CSA)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7x",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 12040,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "d_{v}\\coloneq\\max\\left(0.9d,0.72D\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12084,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Moment for εx, not less than VEd·dv (CSA)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_7z",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 12110,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "M_{f}\\coloneq\\max\\left(M_{Ed},V_{Ed}d_{v}\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN m",
        "precision": 1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12164,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Tension chord force (N compression +)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_81",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 12190,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "F_{t}\\coloneq\\frac{M_{f}}{d_{v}}+V_{Ed}-0.5N_{Ed}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12259,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Longitudinal strain at mid-depth (CSA A23.3)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_83",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 12250,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon_{x}\\coloneq\\frac{F_{t}}{2E_{s}A_{s.t}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 5,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_84",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 12304,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "εx within the CSA limits −0.2‰ … 3.0‰",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_85",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 12330,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon_{x.d}\\coloneq\\min\\left(3\\cdot10^{-3},\\max\\left(-0.2\\cdot10^{-3},\\varepsilon_{x}\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 5,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
